        "es": "Puede ver el objeto que lleva el rival al entrar en combate.",
        "en": "When this Pokémon enters battle, it reveals an opposing Pokémon's held item to all participating trainers.\n\nIn a double battle, if one opponent has an item, this Pokémon will Frisk that Pokémon; if both have an item, it will Frisk one at random."
